WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.205
Dear President Vladimir Putin,

00:00:03.205 --> 00:00:06.334
I'm so sorry that I was not your mother.

00:00:06.334 --> 00:00:08.848
You plan a trip, you want to go there. I want to go to Italy for

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:10.319
four years, I haven't been able to

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:12.269
make it because of

00:00:12.270 --> 00:00:13.109
the pandemic.

00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:14.639
And now this, you know, it's like,

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:15.569
who's going to—what's going to

00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:16.409
happen there?

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:18.029
 But at the same time, he's

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:19.589
being compelled by God.

00:00:19.590 --> 00:00:22.948
Whenever something earth-shattering and awful happens,

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:24.479
we've come to expect grifters,

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:26.219
celebrities, and attention whores

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:27.719
to go to the mattresses with the

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:29.549
dumbest and most self-obsessed

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:31.439
takes imaginable.

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:32.669
That's all well and good.

00:00:32.670 --> 00:00:34.829
Viva free speech.

00:00:34.830 --> 00:00:36.239
But we shouldn't stand for that from

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:41.547
the serious people, the policymakers, activists, and media figures who keep telling us how

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:44.296
smart, informed, and wise they are. 

00:00:44.296 --> 00:00:45.419
That's especially true

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:47.669
when we're talking about actual war.

00:00:47.670 --> 00:00:50.479
So here's a word to the would be wise:

00:00:50.479 --> 00:00:53.157
you don't have to serve up glib, instamatic

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:56.290
replies that would make Joy Behar wince

00:00:56.290 --> 00:00:58.767
in the hopes of building a consensus for your

00:00:58.770 --> 00:01:00.359
preexisting obsessions.

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:01.619
The Democratic Socialists of

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:03.119
America, whose ranks include

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:05.098
Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez

00:01:05.099 --> 00:01:06.869
and Bernie Sanders, don't have to

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:08.939
rush into print to blame America

00:01:08.940 --> 00:01:10.949
first when Vladimir Putin

00:01:10.950 --> 00:01:12.689
defies international law.

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:14.159
Former Wisconsin governor and

00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:15.959
perennial Republican presidential

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:17.849
contender Scott Walker doesn't

00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:19.709
have to turn a hot war into a

00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:21.699
hot take about Joe Biden

00:01:21.700 --> 00:01:23.497
and immigration, of all things.

00:01:23.497 --> 00:01:26.458
Supposedly sober journalists like NBC's chief

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:28.139
foreign correspondent Richard Engel,

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:29.939
don't have to float trial balloons

00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:31.769
about blowing up Russian convoys

00:01:31.770 --> 00:01:33.419
and starting World War three.

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:35.699
John Kerry, Joe Biden's special

00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:37.589
envoy for climate change, doesn't

00:01:37.590 --> 00:01:39.299
have to drag the topic immediately

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:41.159
back to the melting Arctic

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:42.059
ice pack.

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:45.808
I hope President Putin will help us to stay on track

00:01:45.810 --> 00:01:47.909
with respect to what we need to do

00:01:47.910 --> 00:01:48.813
for the climate. 

00:01:48.813 --> 00:01:50.969
State liquor authorities in Virginia, Oregon,

00:01:50.970 --> 00:01:52.919
Utah, Ohio, and New Hampshire

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:54.869
don't have to rush to ban Russian

00:01:54.870 --> 00:01:56.369
alcohol from store shelves.

00:01:56.370 --> 00:01:58.019
Democratic members of Congress, like

00:01:58.020 --> 00:01:59.819
Eric Swalwell, don't have to propose

00:01:59.820 --> 00:02:01.799
kicking every Russian student out

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:04.393
of the United States right this very moment.

00:02:04.393 --> 00:02:07.498
And Republicans like Adam Kinzinger can just say no

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:09.140
to no-fly zones.

00:02:09.140 --> 00:02:10.912
That would be an absolute act of war.

00:02:10.912 --> 00:02:12.869
War hysteria is a real thing,

00:02:12.870 --> 00:02:14.189
and it drives decent people to

00:02:14.190 --> 00:02:16.799
stupidity, madness and worse.

00:02:16.800 --> 00:02:18.629
When America declared war on Germany

00:02:18.630 --> 00:02:20.069
during World War One,

00:02:20.070 --> 00:02:21.419
people all over the country killed

00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:23.908
dachshunds out of patriotic fervor.

00:02:23.908 --> 00:02:26.728
Walter Jones was the North Carolina congressman who got the

00:02:26.730 --> 00:02:28.875
House cafeteria to rename french fries

00:02:28.875 --> 00:02:32.877
freedom fries after France refused to join our 2003

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:33.989
invasion of Iraq.

00:02:33.990 --> 00:02:35.429
Within a couple of years, 

00:02:35.430 --> 00:02:38.234
he regretted not just his culinary intervention, 

00:02:38.234 --> 00:02:39.119
but his support for

00:02:39.120 --> 00:02:41.069
Operation Iraqi Freedom.

00:02:41.070 --> 00:02:42.479
And he spent the rest of his life

00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:44.339
apologizing for a catastrophic

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:46.199
military action based on

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:48.149
bad intelligence.

00:02:48.150 --> 00:02:49.799
War is complex and filled with

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:51.209
unexpected outcomes.

00:02:51.210 --> 00:02:54.328
Will the rush, say, to cut every day Russians out of the

00:02:54.330 --> 00:02:56.099
global economic system have its

00:02:56.100 --> 00:02:57.449
intended effect?

00:02:57.450 --> 00:02:59.339
Or will it simply increase the scale

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:01.439
of human suffering and the resolve

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:03.179
of the aggressor?

00:03:03.180 --> 00:03:05.039
Past wars teach us the folly of

00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:06.749
quick decisions and courses of

00:03:06.750 --> 00:03:08.579
action informed by bad

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:10.799
information and emotion.

00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:12.779
Our elites, especially

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:14.639
our elected leaders, can leave

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:16.739
the glibness to the rest of us

00:03:16.740 --> 00:03:18.779
and maybe, just maybe

00:03:18.780 --> 00:03:21.239
think before they swarm social media

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:23.129
like Russian tanks driving deep

00:03:23.130 --> 00:03:24.130
into Ukraine.

